# Deny everything, then re-admit only the two entries the serving image needs.
# An allowlist, not a denylist: a new entry added under /src must be admitted
# deliberately rather than arriving in the build context by default.
*
!api
!gateway

# Never ship build-host artifacts or the toolchain's caches.
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/tests
